@startuml sequence_mode_change_shared
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Mode Change - Shared Component

participant DashboardModeService as Mode
participant TileHostDirective as Host
participant TileRegistryService as Reg
participant "Tile Component" as Tile
participant TileContext as Ctx

Mode --> Host: mode signal -> 'review'
Host -> Reg: componentFor(id, 'review')
Reg --> Host: same Type as before
Host -> Host: keep instance
Ctx --> Tile: mode signal change
Tile -> Tile: re-fetch / re-render

@enduml
